Herdr Plus

This project contains modified copies of the Herdr Desktop v0.1.16 main
layout and its Spaces, Workspace Status, and context menu mods, developed by
the Herdr contributors under the Apache License, Version 2.0.

Upstream: https://github.com/herdrdev/herdr-app/tree/v0.1.16
Upstream sources: defaults/layouts/main.json, defaults/mods/spaces/,
defaults/mods/workspace-status/, and defaults/mods/menu/. The branch picker
uses the destination naming convention from defaults/mods/worktree/.

Herdr Plus adds worktree folding and creation from a base branch, per-space
agent and Git indicators, and directory-scoped Git line counts. The installed Herdr
app supplies its own runtime, built-in mods, and icon assets; this package
does not redistribute them. See LICENSE for the full license text.
